Original 1983 bookkeeping scripts of the libc directory, kept for reference.
They are superseded: the status lives in src/TODO.md, and host/libc/check.sh
compares the members with the original library.

stamp-headers.sh  prepends the Library.SC version lines to the sources
                  (it skipped members listed in the old TODO.done; that file
                  no longer exists, so do not run it again on src/).
make-todo.sh      generated the old TODO.done / TODO.undone lists.
